To connect to a signal defined in GDScript from C#, you must use the `Connect` method because no C# static types exist for signals defined by GDScript [1]. 

Examples of how to use the `Connect` method for this:

```csharp
myGDScriptNode.Connect("my_signal", Callable.From(MySignalHandler));

myGDScriptNode.Connect("my_signal_with_params", Callable.From<string, int>(MySignalWithParamsHandler));
```
